#, php-format
msgid "The Pro versions of Page Builder Sandwich, Tranzly, Zinn® SEO, Zinn® Cache and Zinn® Backups, and every Pro plugin we release next, from %s a year. A second membership adds Zinn® Chat Pro."
msgstr "ລຸ້ນ Pro ຂອງ Page Builder Sandwich, Tranzly, Zinn® SEO, Zinn® Cache ແລະ Zinn® Backups, ພ້ອມທັງທຸກປລັກອິນ Pro ທີ່ພວກເຮົາຈະເປີດຕົວຕໍ່ໄປ, ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ %s ຕໍ່ປີ. ສະມາຊິກທີສອງຈະເພີ່ມ Zinn® Chat Pro."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-promo.php:562
msgid "Zinn® hosting for WordPress"
msgstr "ໂຮດຕິ້ງ Zinn® ສຳລັບ WordPress"

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-promo.php:563
msgid "LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site."
msgstr "LiteSpeed, ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳວັນ, ການຍ້າຍເວັບໄຊຟຣີ ແລະ ແຜງຄວບຄຸມທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບຜູ້ທີ່ດູແລຫຼາຍກວ່າໜຶ່ງເວັບໄຊ."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-promo.php:569
msgid "The Zinn® marketplace"
msgstr "ຕະຫຼາດ Zinn®"

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-promo.php:570
msgid "Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy."
msgstr "ຊື້ ແລະ ຂາຍເວັບໄຊທີ່ມີມາກ່ອນ, ໂດເມນ ແລະ ການວາງລິ້ງ, ໂດຍເງິນຈະຖືກເກັບຮັກສາໄວ້ຢ່າງປອດໄພຈົນກວ່າທັງສອງຝ່າຍຈະພໍໃຈ."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-promo.php:617
msgid "Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living"
msgstr "Zinn Hub® — ຈ້າງຄົນທີ່ປະກອບອາຊີບນີ້ເພື່ອຫາລ້ຽງຊີບ"

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-promo.php:618
msgid "Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid."
msgstr "ຕະຫຼາດຟຣີແລນສ໌ທົ່ວໂລກຂອງພວກເຮົາ: ເລືອກເບິ່ງຫຼາຍກວ່າ 10,000 ບໍລິການສຳເລັດຮູບຈາກນັກຂຽນ, ນັກອອກແບບ, ນັກພັດທະນາ ແລະ ຜູ້ຊ່ຽວຊານ SEO, ຫຼື ປະກາດໂຄງການແລ້ວໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາສະເໜີລາຄາ."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-store-events.php:147
msgid "Email me offers and reminders, including about items left in my cart. I can unsubscribe at any time."
msgstr "ສົ່ງອີເມວຂໍ້ສະເໜີ ແລະ ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນໃຫ້ຂ້ອຍ, ລວມທັງກ່ຽວກັບສິນຄ້າທີ່ຄ້າງຢູ່ໃນກະຕ່າຂອງຂ້ອຍ. ຂ້ອຍສາມາດຍົກເລີກການຕິດຕາມໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-updater.php:253
msgid "See the Zinn Digital® release notes."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງບັນທຶກການປ່ອຍເວີຊັນຂອງ Zinn Digital®."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-updater.php:302
msgid "The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again."
msgstr "ການບໍລິການອັບເດດ Zinn® ບໍ່ໄດ້ອອກລິ້ງດາວໂຫຼດສຳລັບການອັບເດດນີ້. ກະລຸນາກວດສອບວ່າເວັບໄຊນີ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງແພລດຟອມ Zinn® ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່, ແລ້ວລອງໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ."

#. translators: %s: the download error reported by WordPress.
#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-updater.php:316
#, php-format
msgid "The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດການອັບເດດຈາກບໍລິການອັບເດດ Zinn® (%s). ກະລຸນາລອງໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງໃນອີກສອງສາມນາທີ."

#: includes/class-zinn-campaigns-updater.php:330
msgid "The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed."
msgstr "ການອັບເດດທີ່ດາວໂຫຼດມາບໍ່ຜ່ານການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງສົມບູນ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ."
